WEBVTT

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.810
I didn't do anything!

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:32.230
Some delinquents were fighting and
someone must've thought I was with them!

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:36.600
According to eyewitnesses,
you jumped right into their fight.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:37.850
It's all a misunderstanding!

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:39.310
So you weren't involved?

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:40.440
I wasn't.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.440
Then how'd you get that bruise?

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:47.310
I just wasn't being careful. I don't
think I need to tell you how I got it.

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:49.650
Who do you think you're talking to?!

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:51.150
Kuroba...

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.560
If you can't even explain
how you got hurt to me,

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:55.230
we won't be able to convince the school.

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:58.650
I wouldn't do anything to ruin our
chances at playing in games! I swear!

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:00.730
I won't do anything to burden the team.

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:03.650
You clearly already are!

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:06.600
You're the reason we couldn't play today!

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:14.230
I can't blame them for
making us forfeit the game,

00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:17.150
but suspending us from playing
might've been a bit harsh.

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:19.810
Well, Kuroba refused to say anything,

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:21.230
so the school had no choice

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:25.730
but to believe that he was
in the fight and act accordingly.

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:27.690
I believe in Kuroba.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:30.520
But...

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:39.520
Are we just screwed?

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.810
<i>We were so scared that we went numb</i>

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:45.190
<i>And our legs buckled from under us</i>

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:50.150
<i>We still can't forget the tears</i>
<i>that fell back then even now</i>

